nsole, and select **Eject**. You can do this while the VM is running.\n","mdUrl":"https://dogsbay.github.io/openshift-docs-markdown/virt/managing_vms/virtual_disks/virt-inserting-cd-roms-in-virtual-machines.md"} ?? undefined;
